---
Title: Salsa
Servings: 6 servings
Tags: Prospects, Mexican
Link: https://www.cookingclassy.com/fresh-homemade-salsa/
---

Pulse @Roma Tomatoes{1 lb} (halved and seeded), @Canned Diced Tomatoes{1 can (14.5 oz)}, @Fresh Cilantro{1/2 cup}, @Green Onions{1/4 cup}, @Jalapeño{1 medium} (seeded and chopped), @Garlic{1 clove}, @Lime Juice{2 tbsp}, @Cumin{1/2 tsp}, @Salt{1/2 tsp}, and @Sugar{1/4 tsp} in a #food processor{} until desired consistency is reached.

Taste and adjust @Salt{} or @Lime Juice{} as needed.

Transfer to a #serving bowl{} and serve with tortilla chips.